      "seed": 830264092,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 580799989,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761523200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Launch chain (ADR-0008)\n1. LogonUser(gamewarden-run, LOGON32_LOGON_BATCH)\n2. LoadUserProfile, kept loaded while Core runs\n3. CreateEnvironmentBlock\n4. CreateProcessAsUser(Runner.exe,\n      lpDesktop = \"\",\n      CREATE_NO_WINDOW | CREATE_UNICODE_ENVIRONMENT)\n\nNot Process.Start with UserName: .NET then calls\nCreateProcessWithLogonW, which cannot be called\nfrom LocalSystem.",
      "originalText": "Launch chain (ADR-0008)\n1. LogonUser(gamewarden-run, LOGON32_LOGON_BATCH)\n2. LoadUserProfile, kept loaded while Core runs\n3. CreateEnvironmentBlock\n4. CreateProcessAsUser(Runner.exe,\n      lpDesktop = \"\",\n      CREATE_NO_WINDOW | CREATE_UNICODE_ENVIRONMENT)\n\nNot Process.Start with UserName: .NET then calls\nCreateProcessWithLogonW, which cannot be called\nfrom LocalSystem.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "chain",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 12
    },
