      "updated": 1761523200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Runner.exe <instanceId>\n1. SetConsoleCtrlHandler(NULL, FALSE)\n     clears an inherited CTRL+C-ignore flag\n2. SetConsoleCtrlHandler(handler → TRUE)\n     the Runner survives its own CTRL+C\n3. CreateJobObject(KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE)\n4. start the game on the SAME console\n     no CREATE_NEW_PROCESS_GROUP,\n     no CREATE_NEW_CONSOLE\n5. relay stdin / stdout, write logs\n6. serve \\\\.\\pipe\\gamewarden.runner.<id>",
      "originalText": "Runner.exe <instanceId>\n1. SetConsoleCtrlHandler(NULL, FALSE)\n     clears an inherited CTRL+C-ignore flag\n2. SetConsoleCtrlHandler(handler → TRUE)\n     the Runner survives its own CTRL+C\n3. CreateJobObject(KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE)\n4. start the game on the SAME console\n     no CREATE_NEW_PROCESS_GROUP,\n     no CREATE_NEW_CONSOLE\n5. relay stdin / stdout, write logs\n6. serve \\\\.\\pipe\\gamewarden.runner.<id>",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "runner",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 12
    },
