      "updated": 1761523200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stop ladder: the adapter's method first: ctrl-c = pipe → GenerateConsoleCtrlEvent(CTRL_C_EVENT, 0) · stdin \"exit\" · rcon · rest\n→ wait stop.timeoutSec → kill = TerminateJobObject (recorded in the activity feed). If the Runner dies, its Job Object kills the game: no orphans.",
      "originalText": "Stop ladder: the adapter's method first: ctrl-c = pipe → GenerateConsoleCtrlEvent(CTRL_C_EVENT, 0) · stdin \"exit\" · rcon · rest\n→ wait stop.timeoutSec → kill = TerminateJobObject (recorded in the activity feed). If the Runner dies, its Job Object kills the game: no orphans.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "stop",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
